{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Dragoon","In the great Garubado Empire, a lethal weapon is in the process of being manufactured, but is stolen and subsequently lost in battle. Now the Empire is looking for this weapon: a girl that can call forth the \"Dragoon\" power. She has amnesia and is found by a wandering swordsman in training by who vows to help her find out who she is and why she has such a strange power."],"ja":["竜機伝承",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-3968","ids":{"shikimori":3968,"mal":3968,"anilist":3968,"kodik":"serial-41541"},"kodikIds":["serial-41541"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-41541":"2022-03-25T15:26:46Z"},"title":"Драгун","originalTitle":"Ryuuki Denshou","alt":"Dragoon /  Ryuki Denshou Dragoon 竜機伝承","description":"Когда-то в империи Гарубадо создали смертоносное оружие Драгун, которое позже было похищено. С тех пор империя всеми силами пыталась отыскать обладателя силы Драгуна. Однажды странствующий мечник встречает девушку с потерей памяти, которая обладает этой сверхсилой.","year":1997,"type":"OVA","genres":["Приключения","Фэнтези"],"rating":5.93,"popularity":1033,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/3968/99b32a8b41ffc0b2891865a64a989a41.jpeg","width":745,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/3968/99b32a8b41ffc0b2891865a64a989a41.jpeg","width":745,"height":1000}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-869","dubId":"869","label":"Субтитры","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-41541","translationId":"869","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/976804/c691a1e8be93cde6880f0a1d3cd4f9b9/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-869","dubId":"869","label":"Субтитры","